# Noter - High quality .gitignore (2026 best practices)
# Generated and maintained for a pure Rust egui desktop application.

# =============================================================================
# Rust / Cargo
# =============================================================================
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock  # For applications, we usually commit Cargo.lock for reproducible builds.
            # Uncomment the next line if you prefer not to commit it for libraries.
# Cargo.lock

# =============================================================================
# Noter specific artifacts
# =============================================================================
# Autosave / recovery files (critical reliability feature)
*.noter-autosave
*.noter-recover
noter-autosave-*
noter-recovery-*
*.tmp-noter

# Temporary files created during atomic saves
*.txt.tmp
*.md.tmp
*~

# =============================================================================
# OneDrive / Sync folder warnings (IMPORTANT)
# =============================================================================
# Strongly recommended: Do NOT develop inside OneDrive, Dropbox, or other sync
# folders. The target/ directory + many small files during builds causes:
#   - Excessive CPU / bandwidth from constant syncing
#   - Antivirus scanning delays
#   - Occasional file locking during `cargo build`
#   - Corrupted incremental compilation
#
# Best practice: Develop in C:\dev\noter or ~/dev/noter and copy the final
# release binary (or use a symlink / junction for the binary only).
# If you must keep the source here, at least pause OneDrive sync while working.

# =============================================================================
# IDEs and editors
# =============================================================================
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.project
.classpath
.settings/
*.sublime-*

# =============================================================================
# OS generated files
# =============================================================================
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# =============================================================================
# Build / distribution artifacts (cargo-dist, etc.)
# =============================================================================
/dist/
/artifacts/
*.msi
*.exe.bak
*.dmg
*.AppImage
*.deb
*.rpm
*.tar.gz
*.zip

# =============================================================================
# Test / coverage artifacts
# =============================================================================
/coverage/
/lcov.info
*.profraw
cobertura.xml
tarpaulin-report.html
/mutants.out*

# =============================================================================
# Environment & secrets (never commit)
# =============================================================================
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
# End of .gitignore
